WEBVTT

00:00:42.834 --> 00:00:45.920
To think one could feel such relief

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:48.757
at having reached a sernium mine...

00:00:49.424 --> 00:00:53.678
It warrants a prayer, that
this is not our last replenishment.

00:00:53.678 --> 00:00:58.433
We won't relinquish it. Not to any city.

00:01:01.686 --> 00:01:03.521
Isn't that...?

00:01:03.521 --> 00:01:05.106
The 10th Platoon's...

00:01:05.106 --> 00:01:08.109
Yeah. Dinn Dee.

00:01:13.281 --> 00:01:17.702
Their previous platoon
leader often did that as well.

00:01:27.212 --> 00:01:30.423
That's an unfamiliar roaming bus.

00:01:33.009 --> 00:01:36.012
<i>Brave your truth and brave yourself</i>

00:01:36.012 --> 00:01:39.599
<i>So we can go somewhere with the dite</i>

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:47.315
<i>Keep hope alive, now we</i>
<i>wanna find the new world</i>

00:01:49.526 --> 00:01:52.904
<i>Roaming around the city having lost my map</i>

00:01:52.904 --> 00:01:56.241
<i>Even a dying world</i>

00:01:56.241 --> 00:02:03.039
<i>Let me hear a life deep</i>
<i>within that won't stop running</i>

00:02:03.039 --> 00:02:06.042
<i>I seared the undying light into my eyes</i>

00:02:06.042 --> 00:02:09.587
<i>Refusing to shut them</i>
<i>even when they dried</i>

00:02:09.587 --> 00:02:16.261
<i>I don't believe anything I</i>
<i>can obtain without getting hurt</i>

00:02:16.261 --> 00:02:22.475
<i>A single emotion</i>
<i>directed toward someone</i>

00:02:22.475 --> 00:02:29.733
<i>Splits the steel darkness</i>
<i>like the light of morning</i>

00:02:29.941 --> 00:02:34.362
<i>One day brave your</i>
<i>truth and brave yourself</i>

00:02:34.362 --> 00:02:37.907
<i>So you will drastically change</i>

00:02:37.907 --> 00:02:43.747
<i>Compounded strength and prayers</i>

00:02:43.747 --> 00:02:47.500
<i>Intersecting futures</i>
<i>and wishes held close</i>

00:02:47.500 --> 00:02:51.087
<i>I will give these to no one</i>

00:02:51.087 --> 00:02:52.589
<i>Just tough and alive</i>

00:02:52.589 --> 00:02:57.802
<i>It links our hearts</i>

00:03:05.018 --> 00:03:08.104
I think there'll probably be
an intermunicipal battle soon.

00:03:08.104 --> 00:03:10.357
Has the date already been set?

00:03:10.357 --> 00:03:12.567
That's not the point.

00:03:12.817 --> 00:03:15.278
Cities that by rights
should never meet, will meet.

00:03:15.278 --> 00:03:17.572
It allows them to acquire plenty of sernium

00:03:17.572 --> 00:03:19.574
and expand the city's travel radius.

00:03:19.574 --> 00:03:22.786
This is our only chance!

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:28.124
Loser has to buy dinner. You in?

00:03:28.124 --> 00:03:31.586
Why not? I'll bite.

00:03:32.837 --> 00:03:38.134
I think either our leader
or Senior Sharnid would lose...

00:03:38.134 --> 00:03:39.969
Will you play?

00:03:40.053 --> 00:03:43.890
If you can't hit it back or if
you make contact, it's one point.

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:46.893
The person with the most points loses.

00:03:48.228 --> 00:03:50.230
Restoration-01!

00:03:51.523 --> 00:03:55.026
"A Tender Lie"

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:03.368
Next time for sure!

00:04:03.368 --> 00:04:05.370
Shall I pitch in half?

00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:08.998
Waste no sympathy on the defeated, Layfon.

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:12.460
I will have this pasta course, please.

00:04:12.460 --> 00:04:14.337
Ginger pork for me!

00:04:14.337 --> 00:04:16.589
Hold on a minute! I never said I'd pay for <i>you</i>!

00:04:16.589 --> 00:04:17.924
Huh. Really?

00:04:17.924 --> 00:04:18.967
Of course not!

00:04:18.967 --> 00:04:20.927
At least get me a drink then.

00:04:20.927 --> 00:04:22.554
No!

00:04:32.230 --> 00:04:33.648
Hey there, Dinn.

00:04:33.648 --> 00:04:36.735
You seem to be doing well lately.

00:04:37.819 --> 00:04:41.156
That is Dinn Dee, leader of the 10th Platoon.

00:04:41.156 --> 00:04:46.911
Then again, you still fall into
the same rhythm after the second shot.

00:04:46.911 --> 00:04:49.122
Thank you for your kind observation.

00:04:49.122 --> 00:04:53.376
We've grown closer as a unit since you left.

00:04:53.376 --> 00:04:55.420
How wonderful.

00:04:55.420 --> 00:04:58.923
Siena seems to be in fine spirits.

00:04:59.716 --> 00:05:02.719
You are no longer one of us!

00:05:03.553 --> 00:05:05.180
Refer to us with respect!

00:05:05.180 --> 00:05:06.806
Dinn...

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:11.561
For our next competition
we go against you, the 17th.

00:05:11.561 --> 00:05:16.441
Sharnid... There was
no place for you in the 10th,

00:05:16.441 --> 00:05:19.861
and I am going to pound that fact into you.

00:05:31.289 --> 00:05:36.378
Senior Sharnid was in the
10th Platoon until last year.

00:05:36.378 --> 00:05:38.922
So he transferred to the 17th?

00:05:38.922 --> 00:05:39.589
Yes.

00:05:39.589 --> 00:05:44.177
Why? Their platoon leader
looked like he was really angry.

00:05:44.177 --> 00:05:47.180
Well... That I do not know.

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:50.767
But because he left during a competition,

00:05:50.767 --> 00:05:54.896
it seems their overall standing
last year dropped considerably.

00:05:54.896 --> 00:05:56.564
He left during?

00:05:56.564 --> 00:06:00.860
That is his personality.

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:02.487
So cool!

00:06:03.697 --> 00:06:04.906
But...

00:06:04.906 --> 00:06:06.533
But?

00:06:11.496 --> 00:06:13.331
--Well--
--Lay-ton!

00:06:13.331 --> 00:06:14.624
Thank goodness!

00:06:14.624 --> 00:06:17.210
Can you come with me right now?

00:06:17.210 --> 00:06:17.877
Hurry!

00:06:17.877 --> 00:06:20.088
Uh, bye ma'am!

00:06:28.513 --> 00:06:33.018
What's going on? Isn't this rather
much for special dispatch?

00:06:33.018 --> 00:06:35.061
We received word that

00:06:35.061 --> 00:06:38.606
people posing as students were selling Overload.

00:06:38.606 --> 00:06:40.608
The drug used to accelerate one's kei flow?

00:06:40.608 --> 00:06:45.155
Yeah. Using it causes an explosive
increase in kei and nen'i production.

00:06:45.989 --> 00:06:48.616
It would be of unparalleled value...

00:06:48.700 --> 00:06:51.286
if it weren't for the side effects.

00:06:51.286 --> 00:06:54.956
But its use is prohibited by law!

00:06:54.956 --> 00:06:59.002
Also, would selling it in
an academic city like Zuellni

00:06:59.002 --> 00:07:01.046
even be profitable?

00:07:01.046 --> 00:07:05.467
It's because of rumors that
an intermunicipal battle is coming up.

00:07:06.092 --> 00:07:08.094
They probably thought a lesser city like ours

00:07:08.094 --> 00:07:10.513
would have people wanting it.

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:14.392
There are ten of them. Our intel
says none of them are military artists.

00:07:14.392 --> 00:07:15.894
Yes, they are.

00:07:15.894 --> 00:07:17.020
What?

00:07:17.020 --> 00:07:18.938
So they hid themselves, eh?

00:07:18.938 --> 00:07:23.276
No. On the contrary, they're provoking us.

00:07:29.532 --> 00:07:31.701
What gives? You're going home already?

00:07:31.701 --> 00:07:34.621
Just changin' locales. See ya.

00:07:34.621 --> 00:07:36.831
--Later.
--Bye!

00:08:13.493 --> 00:08:15.912
Today we win!

00:09:08.673 --> 00:09:10.508
Here they come!

00:09:11.551 --> 00:09:13.178
Sir!

00:09:14.554 --> 00:09:16.306
Restoration-01!

00:09:16.306 --> 00:09:17.932
Layfon!

00:09:21.811 --> 00:09:24.814
Nice look in your eyes there, bub!

00:09:27.067 --> 00:09:28.902
<i>A sword?!</i>

00:09:31.529 --> 00:09:32.947
No you don't!

00:09:32.947 --> 00:09:34.074
Layfon! Wait!

00:09:34.074 --> 00:09:36.409
All forces, move in!

00:09:38.912 --> 00:09:40.747
Where is it?

00:09:43.875 --> 00:09:45.043
Let none of them escape!

00:09:45.043 --> 00:09:45.710
The municipal police...

00:09:45.710 --> 00:09:47.545
--Wait!
--Layfon!

00:10:01.017 --> 00:10:02.644
Layfon?

00:10:04.187 --> 00:10:05.814
Shoot!

00:10:12.195 --> 00:10:15.198
<i>Who are they facing? Why is he there?!</i>

00:10:17.701 --> 00:10:19.703
Who's there?!

00:10:20.829 --> 00:10:22.455
I'm sorry.

00:10:23.123 --> 00:10:26.167
I can't let anybody go there!

00:10:27.002 --> 00:10:28.628
Restoration!

00:10:30.505 --> 00:10:33.008
I don't have time to deal with you!

00:10:54.988 --> 00:10:56.656
Yo, Ramis.

00:10:56.656 --> 00:10:57.449
Zid!

00:10:57.449 --> 00:11:02.454
Ramis. Goin' to meet... Gedosh?

00:11:14.382 --> 00:11:16.718
Too bad we can't take the highway.

00:11:16.718 --> 00:11:20.472
I've plotted alternative routes.
I'm ready at any time.

00:11:20.472 --> 00:11:22.682
You're the best.

00:11:28.730 --> 00:11:30.732
I can't see!

00:11:39.324 --> 00:11:40.950
Go!

00:12:01.763 --> 00:12:04.599
That was close!

00:12:06.267 --> 00:12:09.521
Sure enough, you can read my attacks.

00:12:11.147 --> 00:12:15.193
Wolfstein... This all you got?

00:12:18.697 --> 00:12:22.909
You're not givin' this your all, are you?

00:12:22.909 --> 00:12:25.370
You may be a <i>former</i>
Keeper of the Heaven's Blade,

00:12:25.370 --> 00:12:28.289
but you should be able to do better than this.

00:12:28.289 --> 00:12:31.918
You're a military artist from Glendan?

00:12:34.295 --> 00:12:38.717
Yours truly is Haia Salinban Laia.

00:12:40.385 --> 00:12:42.262
That tattoo...

00:12:42.262 --> 00:12:44.848
You're with the Salinban
Mercenary Training Group.

00:12:44.848 --> 00:12:47.392
The same. I'm the third-generation leader.

00:12:47.392 --> 00:12:51.146
I wouldn't have thought
a proud band of mercenaries

00:12:51.146 --> 00:12:54.691
bearing the name of Glendan
would be peddling Overload.

00:12:54.691 --> 00:12:56.985
I could care less about those fools.

00:12:56.985 --> 00:13:00.989
I used them to get here,
and I have no intention of helping them.

00:13:00.989 --> 00:13:04.451
You used them? Then what are you after?

00:13:04.451 --> 00:13:08.997
There's no "what" about it.
If it's not to sell wares,

00:13:08.997 --> 00:13:12.000
there's only one thing it <i>could </i>be.

00:13:13.501 --> 00:13:15.754
The Fallen Ones.

00:13:15.754 --> 00:13:18.048
The Fallen Ones?

00:13:24.012 --> 00:13:25.805
The Fallen Ones.

00:13:25.805 --> 00:13:28.391
The Fallen Ones? Who are they?

00:13:28.391 --> 00:13:30.518
Huh? You don't know?

00:13:30.518 --> 00:13:35.982
Oh, you weren't a Heaven's Blade
for very long, were you?

00:13:36.733 --> 00:13:38.693
Then just forget it.

00:13:38.693 --> 00:13:41.988
Did you know this? Your teacher
and our second-generation leader

00:13:41.988 --> 00:13:44.115
were brother disciples under the same master.

00:13:44.115 --> 00:13:47.410
That makes us cousin disciples.

00:13:47.410 --> 00:13:50.747
We're part of the same
Saiharden-style lineage, right?

00:13:50.747 --> 00:13:56.044
I can't help wondering
why you don't use a sword!

00:13:56.044 --> 00:14:01.174
Unless you get serious,
I'll just come at ya as I see fit!

00:14:07.430 --> 00:14:09.516
What's the matter?!

00:14:09.683 --> 00:14:13.770
Show me some real intent or it's just boring!

00:14:13.770 --> 00:14:17.816
Or did losing your blade
make you lose your skill, too?

00:14:17.816 --> 00:14:20.235
What did you say?!

00:14:32.247 --> 00:14:33.873
Roger!

00:14:39.504 --> 00:14:41.756
Why are you here?

00:14:41.756 --> 00:14:46.761
I like taking nightly strolls. Same as you.

00:14:48.930 --> 00:14:52.892
Tonight's a pretty exciting
night. Don't you think?

00:14:52.892 --> 00:14:54.894
No, I don't.

00:14:55.770 --> 00:14:57.272
Don't move!

00:14:57.272 --> 00:14:59.774
I'll ask you again. Why are you here?

00:14:59.774 --> 00:15:04.195
I told you, I like
taking nightly strolls... Siena.

00:15:05.030 --> 00:15:07.532
Such things would be beyond you.

00:15:07.532 --> 00:15:09.534
People change.

00:15:14.289 --> 00:15:15.707
Do you know?

00:15:15.707 --> 00:15:17.709
Know what?

00:15:29.971 --> 00:15:32.057
I'll say it again.

00:15:32.057 --> 00:15:36.019
I was out for a stroll and
came across all this by accident.

00:15:36.019 --> 00:15:38.646
That's what I'm doing here.

00:15:38.646 --> 00:15:41.483
Isn't that the same as you, Siena?

00:15:44.444 --> 00:15:45.403
Yes.

00:15:45.403 --> 00:15:46.654
Y'see?

00:15:46.654 --> 00:15:50.617
Then we ran into each other purely by chance.

00:15:57.707 --> 00:16:00.001
Well, I'll be going.

00:16:00.001 --> 00:16:02.712
Why did you run out on us?

00:16:03.713 --> 00:16:05.048
You don't know?

00:16:05.048 --> 00:16:07.759
No, that's why I'm asking!

00:16:07.759 --> 00:16:08.968
Really?

00:16:08.968 --> 00:16:10.595
Yeah.

00:16:14.516 --> 00:16:21.022
Why?! The three of us made a pact!
Did you forget that?

00:16:29.698 --> 00:16:31.491
I haven't forgotten.

00:16:31.491 --> 00:16:32.158
Then why?

00:16:32.158 --> 00:16:36.663
I will uphold the promise we
made in my own way.

00:16:36.663 --> 00:16:38.957
You're saying you can
better uphold that promise

00:16:38.957 --> 00:16:42.085
with the 17th than with us?

00:16:42.085 --> 00:16:45.630
I don't know. It's just...

00:16:45.630 --> 00:16:47.549
Just what?

00:16:47.549 --> 00:16:49.926
It's when you start wanting everything

00:16:49.926 --> 00:16:53.388
that you end up <i>losing </i>everything.

00:16:53.388 --> 00:16:57.225
In other words, don't end up like me, Siena.

00:16:58.309 --> 00:16:59.936
See ya!

00:17:37.849 --> 00:17:39.684
Another one?!

00:17:56.409 --> 00:17:58.119
Layfon!

00:17:58.119 --> 00:18:00.205
Ma'am? What's going on?

00:18:00.205 --> 00:18:03.124
<i>I </i>should be asking that! What happened here?

00:18:03.124 --> 00:18:08.546
Um, well... How can I put this?

00:18:23.019 --> 00:18:25.397
Hey. Wake up.

00:18:25.397 --> 00:18:26.690
Shante.

00:18:26.690 --> 00:18:30.777
I swear. All Shante does is eat and sleep.

00:18:30.777 --> 00:18:32.987
Let's go, Shante.

00:18:34.739 --> 00:18:38.368
Oops. Forgot something.

00:18:41.955 --> 00:18:43.790
Who's there?

00:18:45.667 --> 00:18:48.920
Well, I guess you pass that test.

00:18:50.171 --> 00:18:51.798
Wait!

00:18:52.257 --> 00:18:54.592
Why not make yourselves comfortable?

00:18:54.592 --> 00:18:57.220
This is <i>my </i>room.

00:19:00.348 --> 00:19:02.267
You can come out, Myufa.

00:19:02.267 --> 00:19:03.893
All right.

00:19:43.641 --> 00:19:46.227
Your Majesty, I do not
have the words to thank you

00:19:46.227 --> 00:19:50.565
for the incredible generosity you
have bestowed upon us.

00:19:50.565 --> 00:19:54.778
Think nothing of it. Are your wounds healed?

00:19:54.778 --> 00:19:58.323
Ma'am. Thanks to your
concern regarding this matter,

00:19:58.323 --> 00:20:01.326
I was able to devote myself to recovery.

00:20:02.077 --> 00:20:05.205
It was nothing, the slightest
of medical expenses.

00:20:05.205 --> 00:20:07.791
It is painfully little compared to the efforts

00:20:07.791 --> 00:20:09.793
you have expended thus far.

00:20:09.793 --> 00:20:11.711
I am undeserving of such words.

00:20:11.711 --> 00:20:13.338
It's the truth, is it not?

00:20:13.338 --> 00:20:16.508
You have shown your efforts time and again,

00:20:16.508 --> 00:20:19.928
by your own hand and by
the blades you have trained.

00:20:20.261 --> 00:20:22.597
But ultimately...

00:20:22.597 --> 00:20:26.309
His fate was brought
about by his own immaturity

00:20:26.309 --> 00:20:29.646
and a lack of awareness regarding the world.

00:20:29.646 --> 00:20:32.857
You are by no means responsible.

00:20:34.901 --> 00:20:39.572
Do you know how he is faring now?

00:20:42.242 --> 00:20:48.415
Is Layfon doing well?
Are you not exchanging letters with him?

00:20:48.415 --> 00:20:51.835
Yes... I mean yes, Your Majesty, I am!

00:20:53.253 --> 00:20:55.213
And is he doing well?

00:20:55.213 --> 00:20:58.717
Um, currently he is in a city called Zuellni...

00:20:58.717 --> 00:21:00.760
The academic city, eh?

00:21:00.760 --> 00:21:02.762
He was quite unskilled at such things.

00:21:02.762 --> 00:21:05.807
It's a wonder he passed
the entrance examination.

00:21:05.807 --> 00:21:07.559
Was it you who taught him to study?

00:21:07.559 --> 00:21:08.560
Yes, ma'am!

00:21:08.560 --> 00:21:13.106
What do his letters say?
Are his studies difficult?

00:21:13.106 --> 00:21:17.944
Well, it seems he's made several friends, and...

00:21:27.954 --> 00:21:31.207
And that weighs on your mind, does it?

00:21:31.207 --> 00:21:32.834
Yes, ma'am.

00:21:35.795 --> 00:21:37.422
Um...

00:21:40.300 --> 00:21:41.926
What is it?

00:21:44.262 --> 00:21:45.889
Layfon...

00:21:53.480 --> 00:21:55.482
Can he...

00:22:08.453 --> 00:22:11.289
...never return here?

00:22:35.271 --> 00:22:38.024
<i>Beyond memory</i>

00:22:38.024 --> 00:22:46.449
<i>A map of the ideal future</i>
<i>you'd been searching for</i>

00:22:46.449 --> 00:22:57.502
<i>Scared of something, not</i>
<i>understanding, trembling alone</i>

00:22:57.502 --> 00:23:08.805
<i>Unable to see you, I'm</i>
<i>always wearing a fake smile</i>

00:23:08.805 --> 00:23:18.023
<i>I was held in your arms</i>

00:23:18.023 --> 00:23:23.653
<i>Fall in love like</i>
<i>you're waking up</i>

00:23:23.653 --> 00:23:29.034
<i>And then take</i>
<i>me into dreamland</i>

00:23:29.034 --> 00:23:34.789
<i>You always, you always</i>

00:23:34.789 --> 00:23:44.883
<i>You always told me tender lies</i>

00:23:53.725 --> 00:23:57.187
<i>The municipal police moves</i>
<i>in secret to apprehend those</i>

00:23:57.187 --> 00:23:59.689
<i>suspected of using the illegal</i>
<i>substance Overload on campus...</i>

00:23:59.689 --> 00:24:01.816
<i>And Sharnid has begun to notice</i>

00:24:01.816 --> 00:24:04.444
<i>the crime committed by his former colleagues.</i>

00:24:04.444 --> 00:24:06.654
<i>Next time, "The Sentiment That</i>
<i>Lies in the Barrel of a Gun," and...</i>

00:24:06.654 --> 00:24:08.086
<i>Restoration!</i>
